WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.000
You remember the face. The missing name feels close.

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:14.000
In a 1966 study, some people could report fragments of missing words.

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:21.000
In later work, people sometimes confidently guessed the wrong first letter.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:28.000
A feeling of knowing is not always accurate recall.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:35.000
A guided recording can provide structure, not proof of a memory cure.

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Try the free routine and assess what the seller actually includes.
